d>\n<td>—\n</td>\n<td>—\n</td>\n<td>150\n</td>\n<td>130<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"w-cite_ref-ora_1-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></sup>\n</td>\n<td>—\n</td>\n<td>60<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"w-cite_ref-ora_1-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></sup>\n</td>\n<td>120<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"w-cite_ref-ora-iss_4-0\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></sup>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Svargrond\">Svargrond</a>\n</th>\n<td>—\n</td>\n<td>—\n</td>\n<td>110\n</td>\n<td>—\n</td>\n<td>—\n</td>\n<td>—\n</td>\n<td>—\n</td>\n<td>—\n</td>\n<td>—\n</td>\n<td>—\n</td>\n<td>180\n</td>\n<td>150\n</td>\n<td>—\n</td>\n<td>—\n</td>\n<td>—\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a>\n</th>\n<td>130\n</td>\n<td>—\n</td>\n<td>110\n</td>\n<td>—\n</td>\n<td>160\n</td>\n<td>180\n</td>\n<td>160\n</td>\n<td>210\n</td>\n<td>150\n</td>\n<td>180\n</td>\n<td>—\n</td>\n<td>170\n</td>\n<td>200\n</td>\n<td>—\n</td>\n<td>—\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Venore\">Venore</a>\n</th>\n<td>90\n</td>\n<td>150\n</td>\n<td>130\n</td>\n<td>60\n</td>\n<td>40\n</td>\n<td>180\n</td>\n<td>160\n</td>\n<td>—\n</td>\n<td>130<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"w-cite_ref-ora_1-7\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></sup>\n</td>\n<td>150\n</td>\n<td>170\n</td>\n<td>—\n</td>\n<td>185\n</td>\n<td>110\n</td>\n<td>130\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Yalahar\">Yalahar</a><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"w-cite_ref-yal_2-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></sup>\n</th>\n<td>160\n</td>\n<td>230\n</td>\n<td>185\n</td>\n<td>210\n</td>\n<td>—\n</td>\n<td>275\n</td>\n<td>260\n</td>\n<td>—\n</td>\n<td>—\n</td>\n<td>—\n</td>\n<td>200\n</td>\n<td>185\n</td>\n<td>—\n</td>\n<td>—\n</td>\n<td>—\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Krailos\">Krailos</a>\n</th>\n<td>—\n</td>\n<td>—\n</td>\n<td>—\n</td>\n<td>110\n</td>\n<td>100\n</td>\n<td>—\n</td>\n<td>—\n</td>\n<td>—\n</td>\n<td>60\n</td>\n<td>—\n</td>\n<td>—\n</td>\n<td>110\n</td>\n<td>—\n</td>\n<td>—\n</td>\n<td>70\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Issavi\">Issavi</a>\n</th>\n<td>—\n</td>\n<td>—\n</td>\n<td>—\n</td>\n<td>80\n</td>\n<td>—\n</td>\n<td>—\n</td>\n<td>—\n</td>\n<td>—\n</td>\n<td>100\n</td>\n<td>—\n</td>\n<td>—\n</td>\n<td>80\n</td>\n<td>—\n</td>\n<td>80\n</td>\n<td>—\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\" colspan=\"17\"><div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"w-cite_note-ora-1\">^ <sup>1.0</sup> <sup>1.1</sup> <sup>1.2</sup> <sup>1.3</sup> <sup>1.4</sup> <sup>1.5</sup> <sup>1.6</sup> <sup>1.7</sup> <span class=\"reference-text\">In order to travel from <a href=\"#/wiki/Oramond\">Oramond</a> (<a href=\"#/wiki/Rathleton\">Rathleton</a>) to any city but <a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Issavi\">Issavi</a> one must have a rank of \"Citizen\" in the <a href=\"#/quest/rathleton-quest\">Rathleton Quest</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"w-cite_note-yal-2\">^ <sup>2.0</sup> <sup>2.1</sup> <span class=\"reference-text\">In order to travel to and from <a href=\"#/wiki/Yalahar\">Yalahar</a> one must complete the \"Searoutes around Yalahar\" mission.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"w-cite_note-ank–ph-3\">^ <sup>3.0</sup> <sup>3.1</sup> <span class=\"reference-text\">Travelling from <a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun\">Ankrahmun</a> to <a href=\"#/wiki/Port%20Hope\">Port Hope</a> is 80 gp, while travelling from <a href=\"#/wiki/Port%20Hope\">Port Hope</a> to <a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun\">Ankrahmun</a> is 110 gp.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"w-cite_note-ora-iss-4\"><b>^</b> <span class=\"reference-text\">Price is 70 gp for characters that finished <a href=\"#/quest/krailos-quest\">Krailos Quest</a>.</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>Additionally, you can buy daily tickets to Travora for 1000 gp from all Ship Captain NPCs, except <a href=\"#/wiki/Captain%20Chelop\">Captain Chelop</a> (<a href=\"#/wiki/Roshamuul\">Roshamuul</a>) and <a href=\"#/wiki/Captain%20Pelagia\">Captain Pelagia</a> (<a href=\"#/wiki/Krailos\">Krailos</a>).\n</p><p>You can gain the Achievement Ship's Kobold by taking around 1250 journeys by boat.<br/>\nThe cheapest option is to travel between <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Cormaya\">Cormaya</a> which costs around 25,000 gp if you have completed mission 6 of the Postman Missions Quest. However, it takes around 2500 journeys by this route because only one way counts. On the other hand, the fastest option is to travel between <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Venore\">Venore</a>, but it costs around 37,500 gp (if you have Postman's discount).\n</p><p><b>Warning</b>: If you use other coins than <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">gold</a> to travel (e.g if you are only carrying a <a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Coin\">Crystal Coin</a>), be sure to have enough space and <a href=\"#/wiki/Capacity\">capacity</a> for the change that the Captain will give you - otherwise you'll be moved to your destination, but your money will be left on the boat you travelled from.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-See_also\">See also</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Astral%20Bridge\">Astral Bridge</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Buddel\">Buddel</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dog%20Sled\">Dog Sled</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Gnomish%20Crystal%20Teleport%20System\">GCTS</a> (Gnomish Crystal Teleport System)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Magic%20Carpet\">Magic Carpet</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Nordic%20Tibia%20Ferries\">Nordic Tibia Ferries</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ore%20Wagon\">Ore Wagon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Port%20Hope%20Ferries\">Port Hope Ferries</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Steamship\">Steamship</a></li>\n<li>Traveling</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Turtle\">Turtle</a></li></ul></div>","quests":["the-postman-missions-quest"]}